{"about_the_game":"Michel Ancel, the celebrated creator of Rayman\u00ae, Beyond Good &amp; Evil\u00ae, and the Raving Rabbids\u00ae, returns to unleash his innovative creativity on this new entry into the Rayman\u00ae franchise.<br><br>When Rayman, Globox, and the Teensies discover a mysterious tent filled with captivating paintings, they are suddenly transported to a series of mythical new worlds! <br><br>Join them as they run, jump, and slap their way through each world to get home, save the day, and discover the secrets of the legendary paintings!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>FOUR-PLAYER CO-OP:</strong> You and three friends can seamlessly jump in and drop out of the action for non-stop fun!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>3D BOSS BATTLES:</strong> Battle dragons and other epic creatures in an extra dimension! They can attack from all angles, so you\u2019ll have to be on top of your game to defeat them.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ROCKIN\u2019 RAYMAN:</strong> Jump to the beat of a drum, punch to the bass line, even zip-line during amazing guitar riffs. Timing and rhythm is the key to beat these maps set to original and licensed musical tracks. </li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Barbara's Free!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/242550/bf8056ad84bac08e22bcf1348db9350450fe334c.jpg"},{"name":"Rock that castle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/242550/20c2bb896b497533595e4bf7435049e49ca039f3.jpg"},{"name":"Orchestrate this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/242550/ca86d32aff0c8f009a0c297f7465621b80e8a181.jpg"},{"name":"Mad world!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/242550/e166326b7fea0a03a305c5f73d0021666d7262b1.jpg"},{"name":"Splash!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/242550